      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional requirements:\n- availability >> consistency\n- low latency (<10 ms)\n- scale to 1M rps across 10M DAU\n\nEntities:\n- Request\n- Client\n- Rules\n\nSystem interface\nisPassed(userId, rule) => ({ isPassed: boolean, remain: number, retry: timestamp })\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional requirements:\n- availability >> consistency\n- low latency (<10 ms)\n- scale to 1M rps across 10M DAU\n\nEntities:\n- Request\n- Client\n- Rules\n\nSystem interface\nisPassed(userId, rule) => ({ isPassed: boolean, remain: number, retry: timestamp })\n",
